station-event-blackout-start-announcement: To preserve the longevity of station lights fixtures, a scheduled blackout will take place across the station. Crews without means of traversing in darkness are advised to remain in place to avoid injuries and incidents.
station-event-blackout-end-announcement: The scheduled blackout period has now ended. Have a nice day.
station-event-blackout-disable: Scheduled blackout cancelled: Station is in a state of emergency.
station-event-blackout-enable: Station is no longer in a state of emergency. Resuming scheduled blackout.